module server.instance

// The instance: one loop on std.http.server that answers the HTTP routes and
// the /ws sessions of protocol/protocol.md, runs each agent's turns through
// ACP, and turns what the agents say into loom's events and deltas.
//
// Everything happens on the loop's thread, one thing at a time: a frame, a
// request, or a line from an agent. So an event is stored and sent before the
// next frame is read, and a session's catch-up can't interleave with live
// events.
